# The shared Supabase project (staging or production), owned by court-booking-system (docs/PLATFORM.md §3).
# Locally you can instead point at court-booking-system's local stack (`npx supabase start` there; API on 54321).
# The forms only work once court-booking-system deploys site-contact and site-review (SAAS-PLAN Phase 5).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (public). Empty: development uses Cloudflare's always-pass test key and
# production shows no widget. The secret lives only in court-booking-system's Edge Function secrets.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
